From de93b095914ed763cb63a110653236739031e219 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Van Tran <tetcu@fgorg.vn>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 15:47:32 +0700
Subject: [PATCH 07/11] feat(boards): a project board shows the columns of
 every workflow its rules use

When a project sends some Types to other workflows (workflow-by-type), its
board columns are the project workflow's steps plus each rule workflow's
middle steps, before blocked/done/cancelled, so every issue has a column.
Without rules nothing changes.

Patch-Id: board-columns
---
